---
import IllustrationFigure from "~/components/illustration-kit/IllustrationFigure.astro"
---

<IllustrationFigure
  name="gibbs-count"
  lead="Swapping imaginary labels adds a count, not a new arrangement."
>
  <p class="text-base leading-normal">
    Door closed: ① │ ② is the only possibility. Counted: 1.
  </p>
  <p class="text-base leading-normal">
    With the door open, compare only arrangements with{" "}
    <strong>one particle on each side</strong>.
  </p>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-ink/20 pb-4">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
      <p class="font-bold">Count with imaginary labels</p>
      <p class="text-base">
        Counted: <strong>2</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] items-center gap-2 text-center">
      <div
        role="img"
        aria-label="Particle 1 left, particle 2 right"
        class="whitespace-nowrap text-2xl font-bold"
      >
        ①{" "}
        <span class="text-ink/50" aria-hidden="true">
          │
        </span>{" "}
        ②
      </div>
      <span class="text-sm" aria-hidden="true">
        or
      </span>
      <div
        role="img"
        aria-label="Particle 2 left, particle 1 right"
        class="whitespace-nowrap text-2xl font-bold"
      >
        ②{" "}
        <span class="text-ink/50" aria-hidden="true">
          │
        </span>{" "}
        ①
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
      <p class="font-bold">Ignore the labels</p>
      <p class="text-base">
        Counted for entropy: <strong>1</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] items-center gap-2 text-center">
      <div
        role="img"
        aria-label="One identical particle left, one right"
        class="whitespace-nowrap text-2xl font-bold text-series-blue"
      >
        ●{" "}
        <span class="text-ink/50" aria-hidden="true">
          │
        </span>{" "}
        ●
      </div>
      <strong class="text-xl">
        =
      </strong>
      <div
        role="img"
        aria-label="The same arrangement: one identical particle left, one right"
        class="whitespace-nowrap text-2xl font-bold text-series-blue"
      >
        ●{" "}
        <span class="text-ink/50" aria-hidden="true">
          │
        </span>{" "}
        ●
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Fragment slot="caption">
    Swapping the labels does not make a second state in the standard entropy count. Other
    arrangements, such as both particles ending up on one side, are left out of this small
    example.
  </Fragment>
</IllustrationFigure>
